                                ; comes in is blank. Use all.
F771  CD E8 F3                  SHUP:   CALL RXPOLL             ; a byte may have come since the last
F774  3A A0 FE                          LD A,(RT)
F777  CD EC F6                          CALL ROWP
F77A  EB                                EX DE,HL
